.TH WHERETOKEN 1 "August 2026" "whereToken" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wheretoken \- local coding-agent token usage as a character table
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B serve
[\fB--port\fR \fI8787\fR]
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B scan
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B sources
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B doctor
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B rebuild
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B update
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B uninstall
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B community
[\fIstatus\fR|\fIon\fR|\fIoff\fR|\fIserve\fR]
.br
.B wheretoken
[\fIflags\fR]
.B completion
\fIbash\fR|\fIzsh\fR|\fIfish\fR|\fIpowershell\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads coding-agent ledgers already on this machine (Claude Code, Kimi, Grok, MiniMax,
OpenClaw, Codex, OpenCode, Cursor, Trae) and prints token totals, cache hit rate, streaks, request and turn counts,
plus estimated API-equivalent cost and Community Rank when available.
Then rankings by tool and vendor.
.PP
Token math is
.B total = miss + cache_read + cache_create + output
and
.B hit_rate = cache_read / (cache_read + miss + cache_create)
(hit rate ignores output).
.PP
The dashboard
.B wheretoken serve
binds
.B 127.0.0.1
only. In the page,
.B 刷新
rescans this machine. Reloading the tab does not.
.SH INSTALL
.nf
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rainhuang0220/whereToken/main/scripts/install.sh | bash
.fi
.PP
Windows PowerShell:
.B irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rainhuang0220/whereToken/main/scripts/install.ps1 | iex
.PP
Windows Command Prompt:
.B curl.exe -fsSL -o %TEMP%\\wt-install.cmd https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rainhuang0220/whereToken/main/scripts/install.cmd && %TEMP%\\wt-install.cmd
.PP
Homebrew:
.B brew tap rainhuang0220/wheretoken
then
.B brew install wheretoken
.PP
If you already have Go:
.B go install github.com/rainhuang0220/whereToken/cmd/wheretoken@latest
.PP
.B go install
and
.B brew --HEAD
embed the CLI table. The kiln dashboard is in GitHub Release and
.B brew tap rainhuang0220/wheretoken .
.PP
No npm package. GitHub Release binaries are unsigned.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h ", " --help
Show help.
.TP
.B -V ", " --version
Print version.
.TP
.B --today
Only today in the local timezone. The kiln wall (not this table) uses weeks that start Monday.
.TP
.B --since \fI7d\fR
Last N local calendar days including today (for example
.B 7d
or
.B 30d ).
.TP
.B --from \fIDATE\fR
Inclusive start.
.B YYYY-MM-DD
or RFC3339, local timezone.
.TP
.B --to \fIDATE\fR
Inclusive end date.
.B YYYY-MM-DD
or RFC3339, local timezone.
.TP
.B --tool \fINAME\fR
Slice by tool. Also
.BR --claude ", " --kimi ", " --grok ", " --minimax ", " --openclaw ", " --codex ", " --opencode ", " --cursor ", " --trae .
.TP
.B --vendor \fINAME\fR
Slice by vendor (anthropic, moonshot, openai, xai, \.\.\.).
.TP
.B --model \fINAME\fR
Slice by model id. User turns are per-tool, so that figure is
.B \(em
in the table.
.TP
.B --json
JSON on stdout (schema 1). Tables stay the default. See
.B docs/cli-json.schema.json .
.B scan
emits the observatory payload (calendar, drill), not schema 1, and does not take table filters.
.TP
.B --ascii
ASCII box drawing (also automatic on old Windows consoles).
.TP
.B --no-color
No ANSI. Same as
.BR NO_COLOR .
.TP
.B -q ", " --quiet
No scan-progress lines on stderr.
.TP
.B --offline
Local ledgers only. Skip Cursor/Trae account APIs and Community Rank upload.
.TP
.B --rank \fItoday\fR|\fIall\fR
Community Rank period in the fifth KPI column (default
.BR today ).
.TP
.B --no-community
Do not upload or fetch Community Rank this run.
.TP
.B --home \fIDIR\fR
Fake home directory (tests).
.TP
.B --port \fIN\fR
Dashboard bind port (default 8787). If 8787 is busy, try through 8797.
.TP
.B --width \fIN\fR
Cap ranking table width. On a narrow terminal, drop
.B 估价
then
.B 回合
then
.B 请求
before truncating names.
.B COLUMNS
does the same.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B community status|on|off|serve
Anonymous Community Rank participation. Default on when
.B WHERETOKEN_COMMUNITY_URL
is set.
.B serve
binds 127.0.0.1 for a self-hosted rank service.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success, including zero data or a degraded Trae/Cursor login.
.TP
.B 1
Runtime failure.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error (unknown command, tool, vendor, model, or flag).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable ANSI.
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_ASCII
ASCII box drawing.
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_HOME
Override home (same idea as
.BR --home ).
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_OFFLINE
Same as
.BR --offline .
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_COMMUNITY
Set to
.B off
to disable Community Rank (same as
.BR --no-community ).
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_COMMUNITY_URL
Rank service base URL. Unset means no upload. There is no public whereToken rank cluster.
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_INDEX
Path to the local scan cache.
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_NO_INDEX
Set to
.B 1
to skip the scan cache.
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_EXTRA_ROOTS
Extra homes (Unix :, Windows ;, or commas).
.TP
.B WHERETOKEN_COMMUNITY_FILE
Override the local participation file (Unix ~/.config/wheretoken/community.json, Windows %APPDATA%\\whereToken\\community.json).
.TP
.B COLUMNS
Cap ranking table width (same as
.BR --width ).
.TP
.B FORCE_COLOR
ANSI even when stdout is not a TTY.
.B NO_COLOR
still wins.
.TP
.B NO_UTF8
ASCII box drawing.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B wheretoken
Table since records began.
.TP
.B wheretoken --today --cursor
Today, Cursor only.
.TP
.B wheretoken --today --kimi
Today, Kimi Code only. Does not mix all-time rows.
.TP
.B wheretoken --since 7d
Last seven local calendar days.
.TP
.B wheretoken rebuild
Delete the local scan index and read agent data again.
.TP
.B wheretoken update
Replace this install with the latest GitHub Release. Homebrew installs run
.B brew upgrade wheretoken .
.TP
.B wheretoken uninstall
Remove this install. Homebrew installs run
.B brew uninstall wheretoken .
.TP
.B wheretoken --model=k3 --json
Schema 1 JSON for that model.
.SH PRIVACY
Local-first remains the core. Never prints JWTs or access tokens.
Community Rank uploads only when
.B WHERETOKEN_COMMUNITY_URL
is set; this tree ships no public rank URL.
Anonymous daily totals only; never prompts, sessions, paths, or
credentials. Optional cost is an API-equivalent estimate; missing price
is omitted, not $0. Not a global, worldwide, or all-AI-users rank.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/rainhuang0220/whereToken
.PP
Windows installer:
.B scripts/install.ps1
